					"nextDialogs": [
						706810702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810702,
					"content": "啊，一放鬆下來就餓了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810703,
					"content": "這麼一說，派蒙的肚子也在咕咕叫了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810704,
						706810705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810704,
					"content": "找個地方休息吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810708
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706810708,
					"content": "我們就在附近看看，找個可以吃飯的地方吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810709,
					"content": "這附近好像沒有什麼適合的餐館呢…如果隨便解決一下的話，就太委屈前輩了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810710,
					"content": "對了，前面那個建在大石頭上的建築，就是有名的<color=#00E1FFFF>望舒客棧</color>吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810711,
					"content": "我以前聽來蒙德做買賣的璃月商人說過，那裡的菜品很好吃哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810712,
					"content": "作為答謝，我請前輩去吃頓大餐吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "格茜妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810713,
					"content": "好耶！去吃好吃的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810705,
					"content": "派蒙，生火做飯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810706
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 706810706,
					"content": "喂，使喚我也要有個限度呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 706810707,
					"content": "#而且我的廚藝{F#妳}{M#你}也是知道的嘛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						706810708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
